:INFO
Art. 62 Application of administrative criminal law
1 Articles 6 and 7 of the Federal Act of 22 March 1974 on Administrative Criminal Law apply to offences under this Act.
2 For offences under Articles 61a and 61b, the other provisions of the Federal Act on Administrative Criminal Law also apply.
|

